责人需要先拉取各个小店的数","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7377694473444183348","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7377694473444183348","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0105","question_id":"CQ-Q0105","citation_id":"smp-69216bc1cea1418798049bf049945637:7","title":"蝉圈圈 - 一站式多平台达人营销及种草解决方案","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0105","question_id":"CQ-Q0105","citation_id":"smp-69216bc1cea1418798049bf049945637:8","title":"登录入口 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0105","question_id":"CQ-Q0105","citation_id":"smp-69216bc1cea1418798049bf049945637:9","title":"品牌商家抖音达人营销管理利器-蝉圈圈 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1059.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1059.html","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0105","question_id":"CQ-Q0105","citation_id":"smp-69216bc1cea1418798049bf049945637:10","title":"蝉圈圈是什么?蝉圈圈是做什么用的? - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3569","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3569","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0105","question_id":"CQ-Q0105","citation_id":"smp-69216bc1cea1418798049bf049945637:11","title":"蝉圈圈达人营销CRM插件:一键解锁高效达人筛